{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Mpenzi wako amekwenda wapi,"},{"verse":2,"text":"Mpenzi wangu amekwenda bustanini mwake,"},{"verse":3,"text":"Mimi ni wake mpenzi wangu,"},{"verse":4,"text":"Wewe ni mzuri, mpenzi wangu, kama Tirsa,"},{"verse":5,"text":"Uyageuze macho yako mbali nami,"},{"verse":6,"text":"Meno yako ni kama kundi la kondoo"},{"verse":7,"text":"Mashavu yako nyuma ya shela yako"},{"verse":8,"text":"Panaweza kuwepo malkia sitini,"},{"verse":9,"text":"lakini hua wangu, mkamilifu wangu,"},{"verse":10,"text":"Ni nani huyu atokeaye kama mapambazuko,"},{"verse":11,"text":"Niliteremka kwenye bustani ya miti ya milozi"},{"verse":12,"text":"Kabla sijangʼamua,"},{"verse":13,"text":"Rudi, rudi, ee Mshulami;"}]}